        "source_sha256": "961fdbea669b5df7abf79aff3f4b8c3f380fe52754a67fb1609197ea080cbfe3",
        "text": "❤️JOIN ❤️DONATE\n# One Can Change One\n## A Stronger Cupertino Starts With Us.\n# One Can Change One\n## A Stronger Cupertino Starts With Us.\nCupertino is already an extraordinary community. I want to help make it more connected, more inclusive, and stronger for everyone.\nGopal Kumarappan\nFor Cupertino City Council\nVOLUNTEER WITH US\nREQUEST A YARD SIGN\n25+\nYears of\nService\nAbout Gopal\n## A neighbor who shows up\nGopal Kumarappan has spent more than 25 years serving and supporting people—as a teacher, mentor, community volunteer, public servant, and technology executive.\nHis experience across education, community service, and professional leadership has shaped a simple approach to leadership: listen, learn, bring people together, and serve with purpose.\n✓ Teacher & Mentor\n✓ Technology Executive\n✓ Public Servant\n✓ Community Volunteer\n📖 READ MORE →\nOUR VISION\n## One Community\nMany Connections\nTogether, We Build a Stronger Cupertino.\n### Students — Our Future\nSupporting high-quality education, youth leadership, STEM & arts opportunities, and creating pathways for students to thrive and build Cupertino’s future.\n← 1 / 5 →\nStudents\nSeniors\nFamilies\nLocal Businesses\nCity Staff\n“A strong city works when the people who live here and the people who serve here work together.”\nMy Commitment to Cupertino →\nListening Today • Serving Together • Building Tomorrow with resident-first, transparent leadership.\n## Volunteer with Gopal\nWhether hosting a yard sign, walking neighborhoods, or connecting with voters, your support shapes Cupertino's future.\nShow your support\n## Request a Yard Sign\nPut a sign in your yard — or send one to a neighbor. We’ll follow up to arrange delivery in Cupertino.",
