        "text": "❤️JOIN ❤️DONATE\n⭐ COMMUNITY ENDORSEMENTS\n# Support Is Growing\nEndorsements from students, seniors, community leaders, and residents are coming soon.\n## United Across Generations\nFrom high school scholars to seasoned civic leaders and longtime neighbors, Cupertino stands with Gopal Kumarappan for City Council.\nAll Voices Public Servants Neighbors & Community Voices Students & Youth\n🏛️\n### Public Servants & Civic Leaders\n#### Jerry Liu\nBoard Member • CUSD\n#### Satheesh Madhathil\nBoard President • CUSD\n#### Long Jiao\nBoard Member • CUSD\n#### Patrick S. Kwok\nDirector & Board Member • Cupertino Sanitary District\n#### Liang-Fang \"Liang\" Chao\nVice Mayor • Cupertino\n#### R \"Ray\" Wang\nCouncilmember • Cupertino\n#### Murali Srinivasan\nCouncilmember • Sunnyvale\n#### Munisekaran (Muni) Madhdhipatla\nVice Chair • Cupertino Bicycle and Pedestrian Commission\n🏡\n### Neighbors & Community Voices\n#### Madhuri Kishore\nFounder and Artistic Director • Madhuri Kishore School of Kuchipudi\n#### Subhadra Thirumavalavan\nVP • India Art and Culture Association\n#### Kesava Viswanathan\nFounder and Convener • India Art and Culture Association\n#### Rhoda Fry\nCupertino Public Safety Award Winner\n#### Minna Xu\nChair • Cupertino Library Commission\n🎓\n### Students & Youth Leaders\nEndorsements from students are coming soon.\nTitles and organizations are listed for identification purposes only and do not imply endorsement by any agency, board, or organization.\n📹\n## Want to Add Your Voice?\nI’d love to hear why you support Gopal. Record a short video and share it with us—we’d be honored to feature your voice here.\n✉️ Email Video 📋 Copy Email\nSending files or cloud links? Email directly to [email protected]",
